WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:10.280
I was born into war.

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:11.540
Right into it.

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:15.580
People think they understand pain,

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:18.980
but they have no concept of it.

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:22.200
What's the most pain you've ever felt?

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:28.160
Maybe the kind that leaves you more machine than man...

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:29.940
Wait! No! Stop!

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:32.880
What in the actual ass?

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:37.060
Dale! What, why, why are the visual effects not done? It's a metal arm,

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:39.520
it's not like we're trying to remove a mustache!

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:42.380
Ah, fuck it. I'll do it myself.

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:48.980
I'm Cable and I'm from the future and I like blowing shit up.

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:50.980
Pew, pew, pew, peeew!

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:54.140
Reach for the sky!

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:57.000
Oh, no, Sheriff Deadpool!

00:00:57.160 --> 00:01:01.820
You know you're a lot taller in the... 
- Shut up, you little asshole! Take this!

00:01:01.980 --> 00:01:04.160
Oh! Regeneration powers - activate!

00:01:04.163 --> 00:01:05.860
That's not something you say.

00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:08.620
Zip it, Cable! I got the stones to help you.

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:11.160
Nooo!

00:01:11.540 --> 00:01:12.920
No fighting! 
*ding*

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:17.840
They're done already? Oh, wow, that was unrealistically fast. Okay!

00:01:18.740 --> 00:01:20.500
Hit it!

00:01:49.740 --> 00:01:52.160
Your time's up, you dumb fuck.

00:01:52.160 --> 00:01:55.340
Well, that's just lazy writing.

